# Strides. The converters process min(IN_LINESIZE, OUT_LS0) pixels per row, in steps of 4 pixels. IN_LINESIZE is in
# BYTES (4 per pixel) and OUT_LS0 is in pixels, so OUT_LS0 decides unless the input stride is tiny. The luma
# stride therefore doubles as the pixel count: output padding is NOT skipped, it is computed from input pixels
# that must exist (here the input is 12 pixels wide, stride 48). Chroma strides are free (padding is skipped).
# Input: 12-pixel rows (stride 48), U=0x10*r+i, Y=0x20+12r+i, V=0x80+12r+i, X=0.
# 1. crop: OUT_LS0 = 4 reads only the first 4 pixels of each input row, OUT_LS0 = 8 the first 8.
compress i420 0 2 48 4 2 2 2 1 1 002080000121810002228200032383000424840005258500062686000727870008288800092989000a2a8a000b2b8b00102c8c00112d8d00122e8e00132f8f001430900015319100163292001733930018349400193595001a3696001b379700
compress i420 0 2 48 8 4 4 2 1 1 002080000121810002228200032383000424840005258500062686000727870008288800092989000a2a8a000b2b8b00102c8c00112d8d00122e8e00132f8f001430900015319100163292001733930018349400193595001a3696001b379700
# 2. all 12 pixels, chroma stride bigger than the data: chroma row y/2 starts at (y/2)*OUT_LS1
compress i420 0 2 48 12 8 8 2 1 1 002080000121810002228200032383000424840005258500062686000727870008288800092989000a2a8a000b2b8b00102c8c00112d8d00122e8e00132f8f001430900015319100163292001733930018349400193595001a3696001b379700
compress nv12 0 2 48 12 16 0 2 1 0 002080000121810002228200032383000424840005258500062686000727870008288800092989000a2a8a000b2b8b00102c8c00112d8d00122e8e00132f8f001430900015319100163292001733930018349400193595001a3696001b379700
# 3. QUIRK Q-3, i444: U and V are written with the LUMA stride (OUT_LS0), not OUT_LS1 / OUT_LS2.
#    Here OUT_LS0 = 8 while OUT_LS1 = 12 and OUT_LS2 = 16: U row 1 begins at byte 8 of the U buffer (not 12).
compress i444 0 2 48 8 12 16 2 2 2 002080000121810002228200032383000424840005258500062686000727870008288800092989000a2a8a000b2b8b00102c8c00112d8d00122e8e00132f8f001430900015319100163292001733930018349400193595001a3696001b379700
